OL,3,AIan McKellen set to perform as a
OL,4,Ahologram in new play
OL,5,
OL,6,FMcKellen said: "A new Simon Stephens
OL,7,Fplay is always an excitement but when
OL,8,Fit is written to be performed in this
OL,9,Funique way, it feels more like an
OL,10,Fexplosion."
